00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.800
Hmm "Perry Fownhal?" "Fran Woiperry"?

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.650
"Harpo..."

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.440
Wait a second. You don't, you don't mean...

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:34.940
Yes.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.120
No, not really.

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:36.840
Really!

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.280
Okay, really, do you mean it?

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:40.420
I'm getting very excited. Um, okay, I'm gonna...

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.380
I'm gonna go to YouTube here on my trusty macbook pro.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:46.160
