Now Hank, I am not an expert at pwning but that would seem to indicate that at least according to YouTube, we have pwned Oprah.

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:05.800
[Angelic noise]

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.500
Oh my gosh. I'm getting very excited. Uh...

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:11.740
