00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:14.400
Remember that time that I thought that there were a hundred seconds in a minute?

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:18.040
Uhhh, I am definitely... I'm going to confirm this. I'm going to get some confirmation on this.

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:21.540
Okay Hank, I am now calling a brotherhood 2.0, resident mathematician,

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.320
Daniel Biss.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.320
Hi, it's John Green. Do you have a minute?

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:26.340
(Daniel): I have a minute.

00:01:26.340 --> 00:01:28.340
Okay, um your name is Daniel Biss

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:30.300
