00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:39.020
Okay, um, you got your PhD from- from MIT, is that correct?

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:40.160
(Daniel): That is correct.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:46.380
Okay. In your professional opinion, as a trained mathematician:

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:52.580
Is the number 41,818 larger than the number 41,365?

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:54.400
