00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.720
Hi, this is John Green of the vlogbrothers.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:20.460
Um we just pwned Oprah. I'm not sure she's aware of it,

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:24.699
