00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:49.740
Hank, it's that rare occasion where puff levels are caused by unadulterated joy.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.760
Hank, I can only say that it is a testament to the awesomeness of nerdfighteria

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:58.119
